{"title":"Almond Butter","description":"\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Crafted from premium roasted almonds, our almond butter is a perfect blend of creaminess and rich, nutty flavor.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"An excellent source of plant-based protein, fiber, and healthy fats — ideal for a balanced lifestyle.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Naturally delicious, with no artificial ingredients — just pure almond indulgence in every jar.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Spread it, blend it, or drizzle it — our almond butter is a versatile companion for your healthy cravings.\"\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"candy-topping-peanut-butter-4","title":"Almond Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eOur Almond Butter is a delicious and nutritious spread made from 100% natural almonds. Packed with healthy fats, fiber, and protein, it's perfect for a quick and satisfying snack or addition to your meals. With no added sugars or preservatives, it's a guilt-free option for any lifestyle. Enjoy the delicious taste and numerous health benefits of our Almond Butter today!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46598058115317,"sku":"","price":15.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/Gemini_Generated_Image_4atvnk4atvnk4atv.jpg?v=1745927853"},{"product_id":"almond-butter","title":"Almond Butter","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the creamy and rich taste of our 100% pure Almond Butter. Made from the finest almonds, it's a delicious and nutritious spread for your toast, smoothies, or baking needs. High in protein and healthy fats, it'